# Titan 2 Elite hardware keyboard: with "Keep the emoji picker open after typing an emoji" off, the
# full emoji picker opened with SYM closes after an emoji, after a skin tone and after a search
# result, and the next key types into the editor, whatever the SYM auto-close settings. The next
# opening shows the emoji grid again instead of the old search.
# Needs the setting off (the runner does not change settings), the SYM page "Emoji picker" enabled
# after the default pages (device, emoji, symbols; SYM four times opens it), 😀 and 👋🏽 visible when
# the picker opens (recents or the first page) and 🚀 among the results for "rocket".
require profile titan2elite_qwerty
require layout qwerty
preserve keyboard mode
hw type ok
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
wait 800
screen press emoji:😀
wait 500
hw type a
expect Ok😀a
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
wait 800
screen hold emoji:👋🏽
wait 1000
screen release emoji:👋🏽
wait 300
screen press variant:👋🏿
wait 500
hw type b
expect Ok😀a👋🏿b
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
wait 800
screen press picker:search
wait 500
hw type rocket
wait 800
screen press emoji:🚀
wait 500
hw type c
expect Ok😀a👋🏿b🚀c
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
wait 800
screen press emoji:😀
wait 500
hw type d
expect Ok😀a👋🏿b🚀c😀d
